page_title: "Data Source: axual_user"
---
The `axual_user` data source allows you to retrieve details about an Axual user in the Self-Service platform. Users can be referenced by their email address.

## Example Usage

```hcl
data "axual_user" "tom" {
 email = "tom@email.com"
}
```

